## Skill load contracts

Skills pre-load matching deep-dive bodies so cold sessions have full pattern access:

| Skill | Loads dynamically |
|---|---|
| `/handoff` | CLAUDE.local.md + CLAUDE.md + DESIGN_PHILOSOPHY.md matched family sections + DESIGN_SPECS/README.md + MEMORY.md + TECH_DEBT.md + PARITY_ISSUES.md + plan file + sprint MASTER. Scans plan for pattern symptoms → cites matched DESIGN_SPECS + DESIGN_PHILOSOPHY family sections. |
| `/readiness` Check 27 | Composes `/dod-audit` inline; reads DESIGN_SPECS/*.md catalog dynamically. |
| `/dod-audit` | Reads DESIGN_SPECS/*.md catalog dynamically; registry-driven. |
| `/parity-check` | Loads `wire-format-byte-preservation-discipline.md` + `autopopulate-pattern-for-production-caller-class.md` + `x-macro-registry-with-presence-dispatch.md` per scan. |
| `/trace-deps` | Loads `structural-fix-preferred-decision-framework.md` for call-sequence enumeration. |
| `/bug-check` | Reads `DOCS/RECURRING_BUG_PATTERNS.md` registry dynamically. |
| `/merge-scan` | Compose-by-reference reads relevant DESIGN_SPECS when surfacing candidates. |
| `/anti-spaghetti` | Reads DESIGN_SPECS catalog + applies proportionate-response discipline. |
| `/blindspot-scan` | Loads `implementation-layer-blindspot-taxonomy.md` (12-pillar) + reads cited registries dynamically per pillar walk; cross-refs `wire-format-byte-preservation-discipline.md` (Layer 5b) for B12. Fires AFTER `/precoding-audit-gate` SHAPE audits GREEN/YELLOW. |
| `/capture-audit` | Loads `memory/MEMORY.md` (Check 1) + `CLAUDE.md` skill suite (Check 8) + `CLAUDE.local.md` going-forward rules (Check 10) + scans decision-logs (Check 3) + plan-body sentinels (Check 4) + handoff PENDING (Check 5) + DESIGN_SPECS Stage promotion (Check 7) + M7 escalation candidates (Check 6) + Check 11 forward-promise (`tools/check_forward_promise_audit.py`). |
| `/accept-handoff` | Loads handoff doc + "Critical pickup-time reads" files + invokes `/capture-audit --deep` + `/readiness` + reads CLAUDE.md/local/MEMORY baseline + recreates TaskList + verifies engine+workspace git state. |
| `/close-session` | Loads sprint context (Version.hpp + MASTER + plan frontmatter) + current handoff + engine+workspace HEAD. Composes-by-reference: `/capture-audit --deep` + `/readiness` (conditional) + `/handoff` + `/sync-workspace`. Layer 1 orchestrator; SENDER side (sister to `/accept-handoff`). |

